      "description": "Implements compute_requests_hash(requests: List[Bytes]) -> Bytes, which computes a SHA2-256 commitment hash over a list of request byte strings using a double-hashing (hash-of-hashes) scheme. Each individual request is first SHA2-256 hashed, then all digests are fed into a final SHA2-256 accumulator. This hash is stored in the execution block header to expose requests to the consensus layer.",
